9. TERMINATION

  (a) This License terminates automatically as to any person or legal
      entity that breaches any of its terms (the "Breaching Party"). Where
      more than one legal entity is comprised in "You", termination
      applies only to the legal entity that committed the breach and to
      persons acting on its behalf; the rights of the other entities are
      not terminated unless they knowingly participated in, directed or
      benefited from the breach.

  (b) If the Breaching Party ceases the breach and cures it, its rights
      under this License are reinstated (i) provisionally, unless and
      until Licensor expressly and finally terminates them by written
      notice, and (ii) permanently, if Licensor does not notify the
      Breaching Party of the breach by reasonable means within 60 days
      after the breach has been cured. To cure a breach the Breaching
      Party must cease it, remedy its effects to the extent reasonably
      practicable (including withdrawing any copies Distributed in breach
      that remain under its control), and confirm the cure to Licensor in
      writing on request.

  (c) The Breaching Party's rights are also reinstated permanently if
      Licensor notifies it of the breach, the Breaching Party cures the
      breach within 30 days after receiving that notice, and it has not
      received any earlier notice of breach of this License from Licensor
      within the preceding 12 months.

  (d) Paragraphs (b) and (c) do not apply to a wilful breach of Section
      3(a), (b), (c), (f) or (g), to a repeated breach of the same kind,
      or to a termination under Section 7(d).

  (e) Termination does not affect the right of a consumer to continue
      running, on a Genuine PhysiCar Product that the consumer owns, the
      Software as installed on it by Licensor, except in the case of a
      wilful and uncured breach of Section 3(a), (b) or (c).

  (f) Sections 1, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7(d), 9, 10, 11 and 12 survive termination.
      After termination, Section 3 continues to apply to every copy,
      modification, model, benchmark result and other material that the
      Breaching Party obtained or made from the Software under this
      License. Termination does not limit any other right or remedy of
      Licensor, including damages and injunctive relief. Termination of
      the Breaching Party's rights does not terminate the rights of others
      who received the Software from it in compliance with this License.

